  "step_fraction": 0.5,
  "flat_pct_key": "review.flat_pct",
  "rule": "Weight PR needs load > best + step_fraction x smallest real step (active gym profile gap at that load, else load_step[session unit][equipment]). set_volume and e1rm PRs need > best x (1 + review.flat_pct/100). reps_at_load treats earlier sets within step_fraction x step as the same load. Anything else is a tie: no badge. Removes kg/lb rounding PRs.",
  "why_weight_uses_step_not_pct": "Loads are discrete; a real plate or dumbbell jump is a real weight PR even when under 1% (e.g. +2.5 lb microplates on a 300 lb lift). Conversion noise is always well under half a step."
 },
